---
description: Security rules for sensitive areas
globs: ["src/api/**", "src/auth/**", "infra/**", "cdk/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Do not commit secrets or credentials.
- argon2id/bcrypt for passwords; never MD5/SHA1.
- Parameterize MongoDB queries.
- IAM with least privilege.
- S3 without public buckets by default.
- Secrets in Secrets Manager or SSM.
